{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17129","headline":"冬日可爱 · 张正元","name":"冬日可爱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒日临清昼，辽天一望时。\n未消埋径雪，先暖读书帷。\n属思光难驻，舒情影若遗。\n晋臣曾比德，谢客昔言诗。\n散彩宁偏煦，流阴信不追。\n余辉如可就，回烛幸无私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张正元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}